{
    "title": "Basketball Manager 2025",
    "description": "Manage Your Basketball Team!\r\n\r\n[Game Introduction]\r\n\r\n\u25a0 The First Idle Basketball Game Ever \u25a0\r\nDo you love basketball? This game is a gift for you, a basketball lover.\r\nThe matches proceed automatically. Watch and grow your team!\r\nDevelop your team and upgrade players with the automatically collected income.\r\nConstruct training centers and various facilities.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Realistic Game Implementation \u25a0\r\nDeep threes, step-backs, follow-up dunks, crossovers, and flashy skills are displayed.\r\nChoose the tactics and set plays you desire.\r\nFrom archery basketball to hero ball to 90s-style tactics, you can use them all.\r\nAnalyze the stat sheet after the game and improve your team.\r\nEnjoy various basketball mini-games.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Build Your Lineup with the Best Players \u25a0\r\nCollect various players and complete your own dazzling team lineup.\r\nFind your gem-like player from the daily changing draft list.\r\nFind players that match your tactics and set plays.\r\n\r\n\u25a0 Competition with Players Worldwide \u25a0\r\nEnjoy ranking battles against global competitors!\r\nChallenge the playoffs held on Sundays.\r\nChallenge for the top spot with players from around the world!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Manage Your Basketball Team!<br><br>[Game Introduction]<br><br>\u25a0 The First Idle Basketball Game Ever \u25a0<br>Do you love basketball? This game is a gift for you, a basketball lover.<br>The matches proceed automatically. Watch and grow your team!<br>Develop your team and upgrade players with the automatically collected income.<br>Construct training centers and various facilities.<br><br>\u25a0 Realistic Game Implementation \u25a0<br>Deep threes, step-backs, follow-up dunks, crossovers, and flashy skills are displayed.<br>Choose the tactics and set plays you desire.<br>From archery basketball to hero ball to 90s-style tactics, you can use them all.<br>Analyze the stat sheet after the game and improve your team.<br>Enjoy various basketball mini-games.<br><br>\u25a0 Build Your Lineup with the Best Players \u25a0<br>Collect various players and complete your own dazzling team lineup.<br>Find your gem-like player from the daily changing draft list.<br>Find players that match your tactics and set plays.<br><br>\u25a0 Competition with Players Worldwide \u25a0<br>Enjoy ranking battles against global competitors!<br>Challenge the playoffs held on Sundays.<br>Challenge for the top spot with players from around the world!",
